# U32: the item set manage popup's lists (ItemSetListControl, SharedItemSetListControl) of
# allflame_exp_001, at 1280 800 dpi 1.0 (the popups are centred: this script sets its own screen; its
# twin runs the same steps at the other resolution). The stand-in "Manage sets" button
# (OpenItemSetManagePopup); hover a set (AddValueTooltip: AddItemSetTooltip); New (NewItemSet,
# RenameSet with addOnName: the name popup, Save: title, modFlag, t_insert into
# itemSetOrderList, AddUndoState, SyncLoadouts); double-click the new set (SetActiveItemSet:
# the slots show the empty set, a recalc); Done; Sort the item list and Ctrl+click its first
# row (one item equipped in the new set); the popup again: drag the new set onto the shared list
# (its ReceiveDrag: a copy of the equipped item); F2 on the shared set (RenameSet) and Save;
# hover it (the shared tooltip); drag it back onto the set list (NewItemSet with the item, at
# the drop index); Copy on set 3 and Cancel (the copy is removed again); DELETE on set 3 and
# RETURN (the confirm popup: t_remove, itemSets[id] = nil, AddUndoState, SyncLoadouts); Done.
# (One item in the dragged set: ReceiveDrag gives the items their ids in `pairs(value.slots)`
# order, which PoB randomises per process.)
#! u32-expect Manage Item Sets
#! u32-expect Second
#! u32-expect Shared
#! u32-expect Delete Item Set
screen 1280 800 dpi 1.0
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 1172 72
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 480 315
frames 2
move 389 292
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
type "Second"
frames 1
move 595 430
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 480 331
click LEFTBUTTON
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 640 525
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 883 53
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 800 72
key-down CTRL
click LEFTBUTTON
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 1172 72
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 480 331
key-down LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 500 347
frames 1
move 795 379
frames 2
key-up LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 795 315
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press F2
frames 2
type "Shared"
frames 1
move 595 430
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 795 315
frames 2
key-down LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 780 331
frames 1
move 480 395
frames 2
key-up LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 480 347
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
move 517 292
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 685 430
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 480 347
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press DELETE
frames 2
press RETURN
frames 3
move 640 525
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 200 600
frames 1
snapshot after
